  "notable_quotes": [
    "At high loading and high temperature, propylene diffusion departs from Arrhenius behavior and diffusivity becomes nearly temperature-independent.",
    "When compared per accessible pore volume, propylene self-diffusivity in 1D zeolites is similar to that in 2D ZSM-5.",
    "1D medium-pore zeolites are promising for naphtha cracking because they give high propylene selectivity and high propylene yields."
